rehouse lead) glares through mesh.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Beside him, WINIFRED OKONKWO (30s, HR) holds a smoker like a weapon.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nobody asked for bees.", "name": "GREG", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Everyone voted for bees.", "name": "WINIFRED", "speaker": 4, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": true, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Thank you both. Circle back offline.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "A hive hums louder.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "He grins.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "It is not a grin of confidence.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Q3 goals: don't die.", "name": "LUCINDA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["muttering"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]}]}